<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CMC Industries started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CMC Industries started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson Stephens said it started coverage of CMC Industries Inc with a long-term attarctive rating.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Keith Dunne set a 12-month price target of $10-12 and share earnings estimates of $0.50 and $0.75 per share for FY97 and FY98 respectively.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 3/8 to 8-1/2.</p>
</text>
